        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana K136, 3\" Wire Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary 3 Inch Center to Center Cabinet Pull is the perfect accent for any home. Constructed out of solid brass, the unexpected modern shape is an excellent way to add elegance to any cabinet door; and since it is made by Deltana, you can be sure that it will last for many years to come. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-K136-size.gif?v=1704354727\" width=\"365\" height=\"172\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana K136 Wire Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana K136 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 3\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/K136.pdf?v=1704262159\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana K136 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 3 Inch Cabinet Pull | Deltana K136",
                "description": "Deltana K136 Wide Wire Pull - This contemporary 3 Inch Center to Center Cabinet Pull is the perfect accent for any home. Constructed out of solid brass, the unexpected modern shape is an excellent way to add elegance to any cabinet door; and since it is made by Deltana, you can be sure that it will last for many years to come. It is available in 9 finishes.",
